# Deliberately NOT ignored, and this matters:
#
#   fixture/   the three-source corpus, its entity IDs, and the generator seed
#   namespace/ FeatureGroups and list_features descriptions
#   questions/ question set, frozen answer key, grading rubric
#   results/   raw run transcripts, scores, the FeatureGroup register
#
# This is a pre-registered experiment. Its inputs and outputs are the evidence.
# If they live only on one laptop, nobody can verify the result — including us,
# six months from now. Commit them. If the fixture grows past what git handles
# comfortably, reach for git-lfs rather than .gitignore.
